ld thus rely on specific customary law, they could also, as in other parts of the Dutch empire both at home and abroad, apply so-called Roman-Dutch law, a mixture of Roman law and the law of the Province of Holland." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1997, 'temperature': 0.2})
